==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term|ōxta|lang=ang}}, related to {{term|eax||axis, axle|lang=ang}}<ref>[http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/oxter "oxter" in Merriam Webster]</ref> and {{term|eaxl||shoulder|lang=ang}}. See also {{term|axis|lang=en}} and {{term|axon|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

